  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Microsoft AI for Good Lab ran their damage assessment AI models over an extended area of Pereira. Google summary: Out of a total of 152,128 building footprints with predictions in the study area, 8,656 were fully obscured by clouds. Of the remaining 143,472 non-cloudy footprints, the model predicted that 752 (0.5%) were damaged to some extent. Overture summary: Out of a total of 77,589 building footprints with predictions in the study area, 6,582 were fully obscured by clouds. Of the remaining 71,007 non-cloudy footprints, the model predicted that 441 (0.6%) were damaged to some extent. Microsoft summary: Out of a total of 123,924 building footprints with predictions in the study area, 7,731 were fully obscured by clouds. Of the remaining 116,193 non-cloudy footprints, the model predicted that 650 (0.6%) were damaged to some extent."
  ],
